  "briefing": "Vesper Holdings holds Japan through its bonded warehouses. Reconnect 3 relays, take down the site warden, hold the uplink while it broadcasts, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 16 enemy agents and 6 guards on the streets.",
